note right of PaymentAuthorizedEventHandler
    **Why this happens:**
    Circular dependency in
    DI container configuration

    **Problems:**
    1. Hidden dependencies
    2. Harder to test
    3. Violates DI principle
    4. Container coupling
end note

note bottom of ProperHandler
    **Solution:**
    1. Fix circular dependency in services.yaml
    2. Use setter injection if needed
    3. Extract shared services
end note

